= The First Congress of Soviets

On 16 June the First All-Russia Congress of Soviets opened in Petrograd. Over 1,000 delegates were present, 777 with a vote. The moderate socialists hold a majority. When Tsereteli declared that "there is at present no political party in Russia that would say: give the power into our hands, go away, we will take your place", Lenin shouted from the floor: "There is such a party!"

The delegates, by our reckoning:

SRs: [+ seat_sr +]. Mensheviks: [+ seat_men +]. Bolsheviks: [+ seat_bol +]. Others and unaffiliated: [+ seat_other +].

(A decision for or against the coalition is on the floor.)

- @back: Back the coalition.
- @power: Propose that the Congress take power, in a democratic coalition.

@back
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 3, soviet_democracy: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 2, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 3);
RO.boost(Q, {middle: 1});
!}

The Congress endorsed the coalition by a large majority. The Congress established a Central Executive Committee: the party has a hundred and twenty-three of the three hundred and twenty places.

@power
choose-if: rel_sr >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: The SRs will not support this.
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -5, soviet_democracy: 3, rel_sr: 2, rel_lsr: 4, rel_bol: 3, right_threat: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, soldiers: 2, railway: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 3, -4);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -2, 5);
Q.soviet_power_motion = 1;
!}

A motion for Soviet power in a democratic coalition was introduced and lost, narrowly, to a motion of confidence. It was the Bolsheviks' own slogan; we have said it, and meant it differently.
